(FreshRoute Code Review Prep) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Purpose) Tj
T*
(This document is a short review guide for the two major real-time flows in this backend:) Tj
T*
(live tracking and route planning. It explains what the backend does, what the mobile app) Tj
T*
(must do, where data is stored, and the common failure modes you can mention in review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Important files) Tj
T*
(- src/socket.ts) Tj
T*
(- src/modules/tracking/tracking.service.ts) Tj
T*
(- src/modules/driver/driver.service.ts) Tj
T*
(- src/modules/planner/planner.service.ts) Tj
T*
(- src/modules/planner/ortools.client.ts) Tj
T*
(- src/utils/mapbox.ts) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(High level architecture) Tj
T*
(1. Mobile app connects to Socket.IO with JWT auth.) Tj
T*
(2. Backend verifies the token and attaches driver identity to the socket.) Tj
T*
(3. Mobile app starts a session, then streams location updates while tracking is active.) Tj
T*
(4. Backend stores the session and location history in PostgreSQL via Prisma.) Tj
T*
(5. Planner converts batch orders into optimized routes using Mapbox + OR-Tools.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
