(Where Data Is Stored) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(DriverSession) Tj
T*
(- Stores the tracking lifecycle.) Tj
T*
(- Fields: id, driverId, routeId, startedAt, endedAt.) Tj
T*
(- An active session has endedAt = null.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(DriverLocation) Tj
T*
(- Stores every accepted GPS point.) Tj
T*
(- This is the immutable history table for live tracking.) Tj
T*
(- Fields include driverId, sessionId, latitude, longitude, accuracy, heading, speed,) Tj
T*
(  timestamp.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Driver) Tj
T*
(- Stores the latest live position.) Tj
T*
(- currentLat, currentLng, and lastLocationUpdate are updated on every accepted ping.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(How one GPS point is handled) Tj
T*
(1. Client emits driver:location:update.) Tj
T*
(2. Backend validates the session and coordinates.) Tj
T*
(3. Prisma transaction inserts DriverLocation.) Tj
T*
(4. Prisma transaction updates Driver current position.) Tj
T*
(5. Backend emits driver:location:accepted and broadcasts driver:location:updated to) Tj
T*
(  watchers.) Tj
ET
endstream
