(Planner Flow: Mapbox + OR-Tools) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Convert batch to planner nodes) Tj
T*
(planner.service.ts loads a batch and its orders from Prisma.) Tj
T*
(It converts each order into planner nodes:) Tj
T*
(- PICKUP nodes for seller locations) Tj
T*
(- DELIVERY nodes for buyer locations) Tj
T*
(Each node includes coordinates, load delta, pair information, and service time.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Resolve depot) Tj
T*
(The route start point is resolved from request input, env vars, or a fallback average of) Tj
T*
(nodes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Build travel matrix with Mapbox) Tj
T*
(fetchMatrix\(\) calls the Mapbox Directions Matrix API to get road travel durations and) Tj
T*
(distances between all points.) Tj
T*
(If Mapbox fails, the planner falls back to haversine-based estimates so route planning still) Tj
T*
(works.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Optimize with OR-Tools) Tj
T*
(The planner sends the depot, nodes, capacity, current load, route start time, and travel) Tj
T*
(matrices to the OR-Tools service.) Tj
T*
(OR-Tools computes the best visit order under load and pickup/delivery constraints.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Persist result) Tj
T*
(The optimized route is stored as Route and Stop records in Prisma.) Tj
T*
(The route also stores optimized waypoints, estimated timing, and total distance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Realtime events) Tj
T*
(The planner emits route planned, dispatched, and modified events so the UI can update) Tj
T*
(immediately.) Tj
ET
endstream
